## How to run

From the repository root (after `cmake --preset debug`):

```bash
cmake --build --preset debug --target __NAME___test __NAME___trace
ctest --preset debug -L __NAME__                      # run this challenge's tests
./build/debug/challenges/__DIR__/__NAME___trace   # watch it step by step
```
